# The words that name the first one that follows, never the one after it: "komende
# avond" is this evening before it begins, "komend weekend" the coming weekend.
# Each word is also in marker_next.voc, which moves a week, month or weekday forward.
# Wiktionary, s.v. "aanstaand": "eerstvolgend, komend".
komende
aankomende
aankomend
aanstaande
aanstaand
